<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Plague</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 20), Necromancer (guild level 25)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast plague &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast plague</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Leaves the target sick with the plague, a humanoid or mammal. Every three 
minutes, for a little over an hour, the sickness strikes:
</p>
<ul><li><b>Sickness:</b> they feel sick, and are left hungry and thirsty.</li>
<li><b>Cramps:</b> painful cramps throw them to the floor, and take all their</li></ul>
<pre> endurance.
</pre>
<ul><li><b>Coughing blood</b>, more often as the plague goes on: it costs them a</li></ul>
<pre> fifth of their hit points, and the blood may infect someone else in the 
 room with a milder plague. A strong constitution helps to resist it.
</pre>
<p>Remove disease, or dispel magic, cures it if strong enough. Many die of 
hunger or thirst after the plague is cured, so eat and drink. The target 
resists the spell with their mind; either way, casting it starts a fight. It 
is also found on potions, wands, scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Disease</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Madness</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>